# Force LF for every text file Git detects; `text=auto` leaves true
# binaries alone, and `eol=lf` keeps CRLF from leaking in even on
# Windows checkouts with `core.autocrlf=true`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary overrides — `text=auto` can misclassify some formats
# (or get overridden by filename rules), so be defensive about the
# formats that ship with this repo today.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary

# Mark profiling artifacts as generated (not project code).
.profile/** linguist-generated

